{"seq":2,"slug":"feature-selection","title":"特征选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/feature-engineering/feature-selection","wordCount":751,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"特征选择\">特征选择</h1><h2 id=\"为什么需要特征选择\">为什么需要特征选择</h2><p>特征选择（Feature Selection）是从原始特征集中挑选出对预测最有价值的子集。过多的无关特征不仅增加计算成本，还可能引入噪声导致过拟合。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;全部特征&lt;br/&gt;d 维&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;特征选择&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;精选特征&lt;br/&gt;k 维 (k ≪ d)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;训练更快&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;泛化更好&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;可解释性更强&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"全部特征&lt;br/&gt;d 维\"] --&gt; B[\"特征选择\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"精选特征&lt;br/&gt;k 维 (k ≪ d)\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"训练更快\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"泛化更好\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"可解释性更强\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>特征选择围绕三个概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>相关性与冗余</strong>：特征的价值在于与目标的关联程度，而问题在于特征之间的高度相关（多重共线性）。<strong>去冗余与选相关是两个目标</strong>，相关性分析就是为前者服务的。</li>\n<li><strong>选择 vs 变换</strong>：特征选择保留原始特征的子集，保持可解释性；降维则把特征变成新的人工特征。这是&quot;变少&quot;的两条不同路径。</li>\n<li><strong>模型耦合度</strong>：这是划分三大方法（过滤/包裹/嵌入）的唯一依据——<strong>过滤法完全独立于模型</strong>，<strong>包裹法把模型当黑盒反复训练</strong>，<strong>嵌入法把选择做进训练过程</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者的取舍也很直接：<strong>过滤法快但忽略特征交互，包裹法准但计算贵，嵌入法居中</strong>。这也给出了实践顺序：先用过滤法粗筛降维，再用嵌入法或包裹法精选。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"过滤法-filter\">过滤法（Filter）</h2><p>过滤法独立于模型，通过统计指标评估每个特征与目标变量的相关性，筛选出高相关特征。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>衡量指标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>相关系数</td>\n<td>连续-连续</td>\n<td>Pearson 相关系数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>互信息</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n<td>MI 值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卡方检验</td>\n<td>分类-分类</td>\n<td>χ² 统计量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方差过滤</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n<td>方差阈值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.datasets import load_breast_cancer&#10;from sklearn.feature_selection import (&#10;    SelectKBest, f_classif, mutual_info_classif, VarianceThreshold&#10;)&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;data = load_breast_cancer()&#10;X, y = data.data, data.target&#10;&#10;vt = VarianceThreshold(threshold=0.5)&#10;X_var = vt.fit_transform(X)&#10;print(f&quot;方差过滤: {X.shape[1]} → {X_var.shape[1]} 特征&quot;)&#10;&#10;selector_f = SelectKBest(f_classif, k=10)&#10;X_f = selector_f.fit_transform(X, y)&#10;scores_f = selector_f.scores_&#10;top_f = np.argsort(scores_f)[::-1][:5]&#10;print(f&quot;\\nF-test Top 5 特征:&quot;)&#10;for idx in top_f:&#10;    print(f&quot;  {data.feature_names[idx]:30s} score={scores_f[idx]:.2f}&quot;)&#10;&#10;selector_mi = SelectKBest(mutual_info_classif, k=10)&#10;X_mi = selector_mi.fit_transform(X, y)&#10;scores_mi = selector_mi.scores_&#10;top_mi = np.argsort(scores_mi)[::-1][:5]&#10;print(f&quot;\\n互信息 Top 5 特征:&quot;)&#10;for idx in top_mi:&#10;    print(f&quot;  {data.feature_names[idx]:30s} MI={scores_mi[idx]:.4f}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.datasets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_breast_cancer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.feature_selection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    SelectKBest, f_classif, mutual_info_classif, VarianceThreshold</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_breast_cancer()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X, y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data.data, data.target</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">vt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VarianceThreshold(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X_var </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vt.fit_transform(X)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"方差过滤: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X.shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> → </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X_var.shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 特征\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">selector_f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SelectKBest(f_classif, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X_f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> selector_f.fit_transform(X, y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scores_f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> selector_f.scores_</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">top_f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.argsort(scores_f)[::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">F-test Top 5 特征:\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> top_f:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data.feature_names[idx]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:30s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> score=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scores_f[idx]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.2f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">selector_mi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SelectKBest(mutual_info_classif, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X_mi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> selector_mi.fit_transform(X, y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scores_mi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> selector_mi.scores_</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">top_mi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.argsort(scores_mi)[::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">互信息 Top 5 特征:\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-